# FS08 part 2 write regression, EmuDESK (in-kernel desktop, no #Z). Card:
# prep-card.sh desk -- window C:\D3A\ restored from NEWDESK.INF (#W 02 04 26
# 0C, the desk3a geometry): items SUB3A (folder) / BIG.DAT (300003 B) /
# NOTE.TXT at the glyph centres (63,120) / (147,120) / (231,120); the C drive
# icon at (38,30). Every operation goes through the desktop's copy/move/delete
# code (kernel/src/desk/dir.rs: 32 KiB Fread/Fwrite copy buffer, Frename,
# Fdelete, Dcreate, Ddelete) and is confirmed with Return (the OK default).
# Ticks hz_200 after "[desk] desktop up" (desk-arm-m3.py). IKBD: Return 1C,
# Ctrl 1D, D 20; break = make | 0x80.
100 parkbr
400 mark A_IDLE
# 1. copy BIG.DAT onto SUB3A (plain drag = copy)
600 move 147 120
800 down
900 drag 120 120
1000 drag 63 120
1200 up
2200 mark B_COPY_CONFIRM
2400 key 1C
2406 key 9C
4400 mark C_COPIED
# 2. move NOTE.TXT onto SUB3A (Ctrl held during the drag = move)
4600 move 231 120
4700 key 1D
4800 down
4900 drag 150 120
5000 drag 63 120
5200 up
5300 key 9D
6200 mark D_MOVE_CONFIRM
6400 key 1C
6406 key 9C
8000 mark E_MOVED
# 3. delete BIG.DAT in C:\D3A: select it, File > Delete (Ctrl-D), confirm
8200 move 147 120
8400 down
8403 up
8600 parkbr
8800 key 1D
8810 key 20
8820 key A0
8830 key 9D
9800 mark F_DELETE_CONFIRM
10000 key 1C
10006 key 9C
11600 mark G_DELETED
# 4. copy the folder SUB3A (INSIDE.TXT, BIG.DAT, NOTE.TXT) onto drive C
11800 move 63 120
12000 down
12100 drag 50 60
12200 drag 38 30
12400 up
13400 mark H_FOLDERCOPY_CONFIRM
13600 key 1C
13606 key 9C
16000 mark I_FOLDER_COPIED
# 5. delete the folder C:\D3A\SUB3A: select, Ctrl-D, confirm
16200 move 63 120
16400 down
16403 up
16600 parkbr
16800 key 1D
16810 key 20
16820 key A0
16830 key 9D
17800 mark J_FOLDERDEL_CONFIRM
18000 key 1C
18006 key 9C
20000 mark K_FOLDER_DELETED
20200 parkbr
20600 mark END
